    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc0a1a1f0a4b1d2e71e896e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她这番话本身的确很有说服力。\n不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "daec343aa2fddfc6a338582fd21498ee4d1f7fae5a256c3a0db74d8ae762254a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2683d3eab5e7c57671bc9782",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真要说起来，\n「想念」这种现象源自于\n「吃不到原本日常中常吃的食物」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bcf5fa73b688a6bab4b791624ade636ba1b1a71c9ff972f95e89356a2f34be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b0e7bd2d3f0cc366db0835",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "照这样看来，里见皇冠──\n这位里见集团的千金平时吃惯的餐点\n想必都是些高级料理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79ff76c69ec04f72c7097779c04b9544f40b0f4f5acd4f9ade62220b60aa5359",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:972a0f8009f75fe0c075e121",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（所以……这该不会是──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8856e43610a91bb5dd47416bb81326ea4bcab38efb0923f40a19f7c70eab8e56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5b57f3170894fee4828693a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她真的会想念\n今天吃遍的这些日本「平民家常菜」吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab9781423c8f8ebf0a2046ac1c40641c76dff53be363190ffbfac50dfb29a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
