      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我主要参考你同事与家长等人的说法，\n自认做了详尽的调查，\n不知成果如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e8e65108667789ce39322d3e5026d76da63b262353080c750ccb5778b6620ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
