      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真不愧是她，准备得真万全。\n我感到佩服的同时也不禁慌张了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b2839baa6670760b9a62fb8469303d89996fe89b1faac56abae21a9f909318",
