      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……里见皇冠发出笑声，轻轻地敲了敲\n正在努力思考的我的额头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a31fd2dc92956d8a639623c54a0209a859693b95fb08ebaca2d38046147cafd",
